SOAPBOX: I wish ops would take the time to read the wsjt operating manual before jumping into the fray.I can't tell you how many times ops would answer my CQ on my direct freq and then proceed to call CQ on my DF. I actually watched KP2B S&Ping onto all ops DF and occasionally sitting on their DF after the contact to make a few more Qs before moving on to the next caller. He sat on my run freq for his next 5 contacts before moving on. That's no different than hijacking someones CW run freq after making a Q! Should be a penalty!!! Crap like this always leaves a bad taste in my mouth about a contest...
SOAPBOX: 73, Gene N9TF
SOAPBOX: 90 watts to 6BTV ground mounted.
